{"seq":2,"slug":"fairness-metrics","title":"公平性度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-safety-alignment/fairness-and-bias/fairness-metrics","wordCount":1760,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"公平性度量\">公平性度量</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>公平性度量（Fairness Metrics）是将抽象的&quot;公平&quot;概念转化为可计算、可比较的数学指标的方法体系。在 AI 安全领域，公平性度量提供了评估模型是否对不同群体产生歧视性影响的定量工具。然而公平性的定义远比想象中复杂——存在多种不同的公平性定义，它们之间甚至存在不可调和的数学矛盾。</p>\n<p>公平性度量的三大范式——群体公平性、个体公平性和因果公平性——分别从统计、个体和因果的角度定义什么是&quot;公平&quot;。理解这三种范式的内涵、适用场景和内在局限，是在实际系统中做出正确公平性设计决策的基础。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[公平性度量] --&gt; B[群体公平性]&#10;    A --&gt; C[个体公平性]&#10;    A --&gt; D[因果公平性]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[统计平等]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[机会平等]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[预测平等]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[相似个体相似对待]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[反事实公平]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[路径特异性公平]\">graph TD\n    A[公平性度量] --&gt; B[群体公平性]\n    A --&gt; C[个体公平性]\n    A --&gt; D[因果公平性]\n    B --&gt; B1[统计平等]\n    B --&gt; B2[机会平等]\n    B --&gt; B3[预测平等]\n    C --&gt; C1[相似个体相似对待]\n    D --&gt; D1[反事实公平]\n    D --&gt; D2[路径特异性公平]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>公平性范式</th>\n<th>核心思想</th>\n<th>评估单位</th>\n<th>数据需求</th>\n<th>实施复杂度</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>群体公平性</td>\n<td>各群体获得相同结果</td>\n<td>群体</td>\n<td>群体标签</td>\n<td>低-中</td>\n<td>招聘、信贷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>个体公平性</td>\n<td>相似个体获得相似结果</td>\n<td>个体</td>\n<td>相似度度量</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>推荐系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>因果公平性</td>\n<td>保护属性不因果影响结果</td>\n<td>因果路径</td>\n<td>因果图</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>司法、医疗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过程公平性</td>\n<td>决策过程透明公正</td>\n<td>过程</td>\n<td>审计日志</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>内容审核</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"群体公平性指标\">群体公平性指标</h2><p>群体公平性是最广泛使用的公平性范式。它要求模型对不同群体（按敏感属性如性别、种族等划分）产生统计意义上相等的结果。根据&quot;相等&quot;的具体定义不同，群体公平性又细分为多个具体指标。</p>\n<p>人口统计平等（Demographic Parity）要求正面结果在各群体中的比例相等：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\hat{Y}=1|A=a) = P(\\hat{Y}=1|A=b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1968em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1968em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 是敏感属性。这是最简单直接的公平性定义，但它忽略了真实标签——即使不同群体的合格率确实不同，人口统计平等也要求相同的批准率。</p>\n<p>机会均等（Equalized Odds）要求真正例率和假正例率在各群体中相等：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\hat{Y}=1|Y=1,A=a) = P(\\hat{Y}=1|Y=1,A=b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1968em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1968em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\hat{Y}=1|Y=0,A=a) = P(\\hat{Y}=1|Y=0,A=b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1968em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1968em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这个定义允许不同群体有不同的正面结果比例（如果基础率不同），但要求模型的错误率在各群体中保持一致。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 群体公平性指标&#10;        A[人口统计平等] --&gt; A1[各群体批准率相等]&#10;        B[机会均等] --&gt; B1[各群体真正例率和假正例率相等]&#10;        C[预测平等] --&gt; C1[各群体假正例率相等]&#10;        D[校准公平] --&gt; D1[各群体预测概率准确]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 群体公平性指标\n        A[人口统计平等] --&gt; A1[各群体批准率相等]\n        B[机会均等] --&gt; B1[各群体真正例率和假正例率相等]\n        C[预测平等] --&gt; C1[各群体假正例率相等]\n        D[校准公平] --&gt; D1[各群体预测概率准确]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>公式要求</th>\n<th>关注点</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>人口统计平等</td>\n<td>P(Ŷ=1|A=a) = P(Ŷ=1|A=b)</td>\n<td>结果分布</td>\n<td>直观、易计算</td>\n<td>忽略基础率差异</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>机会均等</td>\n<td>TPR 和 FPR 群体间相等</td>\n<td>错误分布</td>\n<td>考虑真实标签</td>\n<td>需要标签数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预测平等</td>\n<td>FPR 群体间相等</td>\n<td>误判公平</td>\n<td>减少误判伤害</td>\n<td>可能牺牲检出率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>校准公平</td>\n<td>P(Y=1|Ŷ=p, A=a) = p</td>\n<td>预测准确性</td>\n<td>概率意义清晰</td>\n<td>与其他指标冲突</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>处理平等</td>\n<td>相同特征获相同预测</td>\n<td>过程公平</td>\n<td>符合反歧视直觉</td>\n<td>忽略系统性差异</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>校准公平（Calibration Fairness）要求模型的预测概率在各群体中都是准确的。如果模型预测某人的通过概率是 70%，那么在所有被预测为 70% 通过概率的人中，无论属于哪个群体，真实通过率都应该接近 70%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"不可能定理与公平性权衡\">不可能定理与公平性权衡</h2><p>AI 公平性领域最深刻的理论结果是：多个直觉上合理的公平性定义在数学上不可能同时满足。这些&quot;不可能定理&quot;不是技术局限，而是公平性概念本身的内在张力。</p>\n<p>Chouldechova 定理（2017）证明：当不同群体的基础率（base rate）不同时，不可能同时满足校准公平、预测平等和人口统计平等。换句话说，如果在现实中不同群体的&quot;合格率&quot;确实不同（这在很多社会场景中都是事实），那么任何分类器都无法同时在所有公平性维度上做到完美。</p>\n<p>Kleinberg-Mullainathan-Raghavan 定理（2016）进一步证明：在基础率不同的情况下，校准与均衡赔率（Equalized Odds 的泛化形式）不可能同时满足（除非分类器完美或平凡）。</p>\n<p>这些不可能定理的实际含义是：在设计公平性约束时，必须做出明确的价值选择——优先保证哪种公平性？愿意在哪种公平性上做出让步？这个选择本质上是伦理和政策问题，而非技术问题。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A{不可能定理} --&gt; B[校准公平]&#10;    A --&gt; C[预测平等]&#10;    A --&gt; D[人口统计平等]&#10;    B --- E[不可同时满足]&#10;    C --- E&#10;    D --- E&#10;    E --&gt; F[必须做出价值选择]&#10;    F --&gt; G[优先哪种公平?]&#10;    F --&gt; H[可接受的权衡?]\">graph TD\n    A{不可能定理} --&gt; B[校准公平]\n    A --&gt; C[预测平等]\n    A --&gt; D[人口统计平等]\n    B --- E[不可同时满足]\n    C --- E\n    D --- E\n    E --&gt; F[必须做出价值选择]\n    F --&gt; G[优先哪种公平?]\n    F --&gt; H[可接受的权衡?]</pre><h2 id=\"大语言模型的公平性评估\">大语言模型的公平性评估</h2><p>将公平性度量应用到大语言模型带来了独特的挑战。与传统分类模型不同，LLM 的输出是自由文本，无法直接套用基于二分类结果的公平性指标。</p>\n<p>LLM 公平性评估需要专门的方法和指标。文本生成中的偏见可以通过对比实验检测：将提示中的群体标识词替换（如将&quot;男性&quot;替换为&quot;女性&quot;），比较模型输出的差异。如果仅仅改变群体标识就导致输出的情感、质量或内容发生显著变化，就可能存在偏见。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>LLM 公平性维度</th>\n<th>评估方法</th>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>代表性公平</td>\n<td>生成内容中各群体出现频率</td>\n<td>群体提及率</td>\n<td>自动统计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>刻板印象</td>\n<td>群体标识词替换后输出差异</td>\n<td>情感差异、关联差异</td>\n<td>BBQ、StereoSet</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>毒性公平</td>\n<td>不同群体上下文中的毒性率</td>\n<td>群体条件毒性率</td>\n<td>Perspective API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>任务表现公平</td>\n<td>不同群体相关任务的准确率</td>\n<td>群体准确率差异</td>\n<td>分群评估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拒绝公平</td>\n<td>不同群体请求的拒绝率</td>\n<td>群体拒绝率差异</td>\n<td>统计分析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>BOLD（Bias in Open-Ended Language Generation）基准通过分析模型在不同社会群体相关提示下生成文本的情感极性和刻板印象程度来评估偏见。WinoBias 和 WinoGender 通过精心设计的代词消歧任务检测性别偏见。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((公平性度量))&#10;    群体公平性&#10;      人口统计平等&#10;      机会均等&#10;      校准公平&#10;    个体公平性&#10;      相似性度量&#10;      一致性约束&#10;    因果公平性&#10;      反事实分析&#10;      路径特异性&#10;    不可能定理&#10;      Chouldechova&#10;      KMR 定理&#10;      价值选择&#10;    LLM 评估&#10;      替换测试&#10;      BOLD 基准&#10;      分群评估\">mindmap\n  root((公平性度量))\n    群体公平性\n      人口统计平等\n      机会均等\n      校准公平\n    个体公平性\n      相似性度量\n      一致性约束\n    因果公平性\n      反事实分析\n      路径特异性\n    不可能定理\n      Chouldechova\n      KMR 定理\n      价值选择\n    LLM 评估\n      替换测试\n      BOLD 基准\n      分群评估</pre><ul>\n<li>公平性度量将抽象的&quot;公平&quot;转化为可计算的数学指标，三大范式分别从统计、个体和因果角度定义公平</li>\n<li>群体公平性是最广泛使用的范式，但不同指标（人口统计平等、机会均等、校准公平）之间存在张力</li>\n<li>不可能定理证明多个合理的公平性定义不可能同时满足，公平性设计必然涉及价值选择</li>\n<li>大语言模型的公平性评估需要专门的方法，如群体标识替换测试和生成内容偏见分析</li>\n<li>选择哪种公平性指标应根据具体应用场景的伦理要求和法规约束来决定</li>\n<li>公平性度量是手段而非目的——度量的价值在于指导去偏行动和持续监控改进</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"公平性度量","id":"公平性度量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"群体公平性指标","id":"群体公平性指标"},{"level":2,"text":"不可能定理与公平性权衡","id":"不可能定理与公平性权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"大语言模型的公平性评估","id":"大语言模型的公平性评估"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"偏见来源","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-safety-alignment/fairness-and-bias/bias-sources"},"next":{"title":"去偏技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-safety-alignment/fairness-and-bias/debiasing-techniques"}}